tr.td:
Concomitant use of CHCs with thyroid hormone replacement therapy or corticosteroid replacement therapy may increase systemic exposure of thyroid-binding and cortisol-binding globulin [see 



                                       Warnings and Precautions (5.11)
                                    ].

The dose of replacement thyroid hormone or cortisol therapy may need to be increased. Consult the approved product labeling for the therapy in use. [See 



                                       Warnings and Precautions (5.11)
                                    ].
